@template brisk
// One of the ten voice templates (the head writer, with social B). Its words match section 20c's VOICE_FALLBACK, so
// baking it changes nothing; the template's own lines (content/templates/brisk.lines) come in wave 2.
talk: Efficient, clipped, practical; statements over questions.
hi: Morning | Right then
bye: Carry on | Right. Back to it
yes: Agreed | Very well
thanks: Noted. Thank you | Good work
wow: Impressive
sigh: Hm
nick: - | cadet | - | - | -
needs: practical
